Package: tidytmle
Title: Targeted Maximum Likelihood Estimation for Tidymodels
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Michael", "Espero", email = "michael@tidytmle.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Semiparametric Targeted Maximum Likelihood Estimation (TMLE) and
    cross-fitted causal inference orchestration built natively on top of
    'tidymodels'. Supports 'workflows' and 'workflowsets' as cross-validated
    Super Learner nuisance models via 'rsample', role-aware 'recipes'
    splitting, automatic informative-missingness handling, adaptive positivity
    truncation, joint Efficient Influence Function (EIF) multi-estimand
    inference, instant 'retarget()' without ML refitting, Modified Treatment
    Policies, and Doubly Robust CATE estimation.
